🎯 Number Guessing Game
📌 Project Overview

This is a simple Python based Number Guessing Game.
The program generates a secret number and asks the user to guess it.
Based on the input, the system gives feedback until the correct number is guessed.

🚀 Features
Infinite loop until correct guess
User input handling
Conditional logic for feedback
Displays result when user wins
🧠 Concept Used
While loop
If elif else conditions
User input handling
Loop control using break
💻 Code Implementation
secret = 7

while True:
    guess = int(input("Enter your guess: "))

    if guess < secret:
        print("Too Low")
    elif guess > secret:
        print("Too High")
    else:
        print("You Won!")
        break
▶️ How to Run
Install Python
Copy the code into a file named guess_game.py
Run the file
python guess_game.py
